import { api } from '@/lib/api';import { TicketActions } from '@/components/TicketActions';export default async function Page({params}:{params:Promise<{id:string}>}){const {id}=await params;const [t,agents]=await Promise.all([api.ticket(id),api.agents()]);return <><div className="mb-6"><p className="text-sm text-slate-500">Ticket #{t.id}</p><h1 className="text-3xl font-black">{t.subject}</h1></div><div className="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_340px]"><article className="card p-6"><div className="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2"><Info n="Customer" v={t.customer_name}/><Info n="Email" v={t.customer_email}/><Info n="Priority" v={t.priority}/><Info n="Category" v={t.category}/><Info n="Status" v={t.status}/><Info n="Agent" v={t.agent_name??'Unassigned'}/><Info n="Created" v={new Date(t.created_at).toLocaleString()}/><Info n="Updated" v={new Date(t.updated_at).toLocaleString()}/></div><div className="mt-6 border-t pt-6"><h2 className="font-bold">Description</h2><p className="mt-2 whitespace-pre-wrap leading-7 text-slate-700">{t.description}</p></div></article><TicketActions ticket={t} agents={agents}/></div></>};function Info({n,v}:{n:string;v:string}){return <div><p className="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-400">{n}</p><p className="mt-1 font-medium">{v}</p></div>}
